            "review_title": "Review at Veranda",
            "review_text": "Marlon F\n7 contributions\n0\nPeaceful restaurant surrounded by nature\nMar 2026 • Solo\nThis restaurant is a hidden gem, I'm so glad I discovered it! It's an oasis of peace and harmony. 🥰✨\n\nWhile sitting on the veranda, you can admire the view of the mountains, the surrounding nature, and the sea in the distance. Pleasant, quiet music and a few roosters crowing in the background provide a pleasant ambiance. 🌿☀️\n\nThe service is excellent, and the food is first-class, fresh, and incredibly delicious. There's a wide selection of dishes, both meat and vegetarian. Plus, the value for money is unbeatable. 😋\n\nThe menu is available in Russian and English.\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2026",
